  "baseCommit": "ae873085846f3145398ca8567a1923d4a4bbe61d",
  "milestone": "Confirmed physical bind-on-pickup loot creation",
  "classification": "Implemented Source binding/capacity correction through real public LootInstance.GiveLoot and Player/Inventory/Item routines with prepared metadata/session; SQLite full Player save/retry/reload; broader loot/retail remains open.",
  "behavior": [
    "Existing public BOP prompt/confirmation flow is retained. Supported physical Inventory uses existing TryCreateSoulboundItem before first inventory publication.",
    "Confirmed BOP quantity merges only into compatible bound stacks; existing unbound quantity remains unbound and unchanged. Physical bound capacity excludes satchel/unbound stack space.",
    "Original inventory mutation lease refusal leaves LootInstanceItem undelivered and retryable; full bag can retry after space is freed.",
    "Existing custom-inventory capability fallback,non-BOP,currency/account/virtual and roll/master policy remain.",
    "Accepted bound Items survive failed full Player SQLite save,retry,fresh actor reload and ordinary post-Delivered duplicate attempts."
  ],
